title: SkylerFinalAClue0
---
Skyler: I’ve been painting the set of our upcoming drama production, Principal Judge! It’s real hard work, you know. #line:skyler_final_A_C00
===

title: SkylerFinalAClue1
---
Skyler: Oh, these things? They’re just stage props! Well, you know I didn’t get THE LEAD role, but I’m a professional! I take my supporting role of, uh… the thief, very seriously. #line:skyler_final_A_C01
===

title: WarholFinalAClue0
---
Teacher Warhol: Of course I have the key to where the mascot is stored! All the teachers have a copy of it. In fact, I was checking if Pork Pie needed a nicer pop art shirt before it went missing. #line:warhol_final_A_C00
===

title: WarholFinalAClue1
---
Teacher Warhol: Oh, my! That must have happened while painting one of my masterpieces this morning! It will be an absolute chore to remove the stains, but that is the sacrifice an artist must make. #line:warhol_final_A_C01
===

title: MoxieFinalAClue0
---
Moxie: Look, I can explain! I found it lying around outside the school auditorium and wanted to show it to you. I think someone really has it out for you! #line:moxie_final_A_C00
===

title: MoxieFinalAClue1
---
Moxie: Oh, that’s old news. We were looking for a place to set up shop for the Fizzy Dizzles, see, and what better than the abandoned hallway? Or so I thought. #line:moxie_final_A_C01
===


title: FinalASuccess
---
Teacher Warhol: Well, I’m pleased that all the fuss over the mascot has been sorted out! Who knew that Skyler would stoop to such behavior? Oh, how the star has fallen! Though I have to say that all this excitement has inspired me to design a new outfit for Pork Pie! #line:warhol_final_A_success

Moxie: Phew! That’s a relief. I mean, hey, for once it wasn’t me, right? Only when it comes to candy, hehe! Fine, that was a bad joke. Don’t get me wrong though, it’s nice to have Pork Pie back. Skyler was kinda insufferable anyway. He always talked {"#$@!%"} about you. Hehe, sorry! #line:moxie_final_A_success
===

title: FinalAFailure
---
Superintendent: GOSH DARN IT, JUDGE!! How on earth did you miss out on that drama brat? Thanks to Teacher Warhol’s sleuthing, we have evidence that Skyler broke into the storage room and stole Pork Pie! Rumor has it, he’s been out to get you fired since day one, just so he could do as he pleases again. Guess what? His dreams have come true. Yes, you heard me right! You are NO LONGER Principal of the esteemed Hard Knocks Academy. Consider yourself fired for such a wanton display of incompetency!! #line:final_A_failure
===